{"server":"en","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_07_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_07","title":"11:08P.M.","storyCode":"CB-7","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"40b695fad935f8f0a04c1720293e86a1bb2ae93e7ae9cd3e847da53852eae746","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"In the chaos of battle, Mostima reappears and suppresses the enemy leader with ease. However, a sandstorm appears without warning, and the Rat King appears to disperse the crowd.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"*Pant* *pant...*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Capone","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"Come on, Penguins!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like you two get along great?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Capone","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"Grr!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"What'd I ever do to you?! I'll clock you one!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Gah! Whose side are you on?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"It- it wasn't me! It was that angel!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Oopsie. I missed. Seems fine though."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Get 'em, while they're—— Agh! What are you choppin' at me for?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, but I gotta stay loyal to the boss!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Me too!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing on the ground? Get up and fight if you ain't dead!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Y- yessir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"You can't be so rough with your employees. Do they at least get hazard pay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"It's kind of hard to tell who's who. Just try to get everyone wearing black on the ground."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Hoo yeah this is a mess."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure is—— woah! Mostima?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"But it looks like you're all doing okay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"When did you get here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"The boss called me."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Capone","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, it's that weird-lookin' Sankta."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Get outta here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Somebody needs to calm down a bit."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you even fighting over here? Let's all take a step back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"She stopped the boss?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"No! It's that staff! Look out, boss! She's a caster!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Capone","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"...Looks like we were right not to take her head on... Hey, don't get near 'em!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"I ain't never seen a Sankta like you before. Or wait? Are you a Sarkaz? What the hell are you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm just an ordinary Messenger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Cazzata!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Grrr——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Time for an intermission... or are you not going to listen to me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Who do you think you are?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"How are you all doing? It's been a long time, hasn't it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! Eyes over here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"A couple years, I think? Maybe a couple months?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Gah!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"When your days are as rich and full as ours, you kinda lose track of time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's been about four years and three months, Mostima."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, that's pretty long."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't give me that face. If you keep looking that gloomy I'll think you've gotten sick."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Isn't this a touching reunion?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Touching or not, it's definitely not the time to be reminiscing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you really going to do it here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll do only what needs doing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...Okay. Just go easy on them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"And it looks like I've got another customer waiting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter how many times I see it, I'm always impressed how Mostima will wave her staff around all light and subtle, only to have some big amazing thing come out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"The mobsters're already scared stiff!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew. I guess I should plug a couple of them?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong? Are we done?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"You may have some moves, but you can bet I'm not lettin' you stroll outta here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't always have to play the big bad wolf. Just treat this as some after dinner exercise—— Hm."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh- what's going on? Did this fire just turn solid?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"...seems like Yith is around here somewhere. We better wrap this up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Who are you monologing at? Come at me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"You keep losing your temper. That's a really bad look for the head of a family. How are you going to keep control of the situation?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Grrr! This smug attitude of yours really pisses me off!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Arts! Take cover!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll take the Penguins. Don't wanna get in your way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"They're underestimating us. Show them what we can do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"You got it! Yeeeeeeehaw!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"That's Mostima, the Messenger..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"A Messenger... are Messengers really all like this?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"...is that the wind?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"...wind?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Texas! Run! Quick!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...Right!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! What's with the earthquake?! What did that caster just do?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Honestly. Old people are so impatient."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"You ain't gettin'——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Ack——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Capone","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! It's Arts! Let's get outta here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"A sandstorm? Here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Croissant","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"Things're gettin' kinda weird."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sora","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"Texas! Over here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"What about Bison and Mostima? Nng!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"The sandstorm cut them off. I'll get them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, Exusiai!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Every time Mostima's involved, she loses control like this."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Texas! Mostima! Where are you?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Gah... there's sand in my eyes——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bison","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"Mostima!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"Shield yourself from the sand and come with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mostima","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"...That's one old man we don't want to provoke within striking range."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"The ground... I'm sinking...! It's quicksand! Run! Don't get swallowed up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss! What do we do?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are they? Where's Capone?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"They ran out under the cover of the sandstorm! We got a few of our guys in their crew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mafioso B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss! This place is gonna collapse!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"...Run. We'll get another shot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gambino","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"Shit! What the hell happened?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rat King","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"Another shot... hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rat King","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"Strange... I don't remember you having any shots left."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["Sora"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["Croissant"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["Mostima"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["Bison"]}]}
